ATTRIBUTION

  T. R. Azany, Y. Nugraha, and M. E. Aminanto, "Automatic Construction of
  VERIS A4-Aligned Cyber Incident Records from Indonesian Data Breach
  Narratives Using Large Language Models," in Proc. Workshop on Adversarial
  and Robust Threat Management (ARTMAN), co-located with the 42nd Annual
  Computer Security Applications Conference (ACSAC), 2026.

PROVENANCE AND LIMITS

  The incident narratives were collected from publicly available sources:
  news media, security vendor reporting, regulatory disclosures and other
  open-source intelligence. No non-public material is included, and no
  attempt was made to re-identify any individual beyond what the public
  sources had already disclosed.

  The gold-standard annotations are human judgements about public reports.
  They record what a report asserted, not an adjudicated finding of fact
  about any named organisation, and should not be cited as one.

